From 72c4b2058279ad56dcc2ae7647bd0f036e773043 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pankaj Dev <pankaj.dev@st.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Nov 2022 11:36:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 043/120] usb: dwc3: fix incrx_mode setting for
 INCRX_BURST_MODE

incrx_mode is incorrectly set to UNDEF_LENGTH_BURST_MODE when
only one burst-type is provided in DT

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/u-boot.git 4846eb08a03c39dda8cc0fbe7def39bbd43bd74d usb: dwc3: fix incrx_mode setting for INCRX_BURST_MODE]
Signed-off-by: Pankaj Dev <pankaj.dev@st.com>
Change-Id: I3eb95f2a650e13b537dc321a6a97aaeefa0dc16f
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/u-boot/+/303890
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrice CHOTARD <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
index e277565b6eb..7f90eeb7648 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
@@ -1160,7 +1160,8 @@ void dwc3_of_parse(struct dwc3 *dwc)
 				       i, &val))
 			break;
 
-		dwc->incrx_mode = INCRX_UNDEF_LENGTH_BURST_MODE;
+		if (i > 0)
+			dwc->incrx_mode = INCRX_UNDEF_LENGTH_BURST_MODE;
 		dwc->incrx_size = max(dwc->incrx_size, val);
 	}
 }
-- 
